WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,350
So many phoenixes

2
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:06,870
One next door and one separated by food

3
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:08,870
His dimples are as dark as the emperor’s

4
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:10,190
There's not much space

5
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,930
This is the little princess that the queen recognizes

6
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:14,950
Standing among the phoenixes

7
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:17,390
Don’t you think you’re being idle? You’re scolding me a little.

8
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:19,190
I'll pay the blood rent later and leave in the morning.

9
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:22,790
Why don't Baozi fill in your degrees?

10
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:24,190
I can see it from behind too

11
00:00:24,390 --> 00:00:25,750
You have nothing to be ashamed of

12
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,980
What do you mean I have it?

13
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,060
The sacrifice begins

14
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:33,300
Red Phoenix Bloodline

15
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,500
High purity
